I've left out the enrichment fetch and the `http-client` import. My earlier response was stopped partway through, and I won't produce that part again. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, and the fetch would send each item's untrusted text to an outside endpoint. Once the graph definition grants `http-client`, the node can be regenerated with it. The node's output is the same either way.

